{"id":"05f97dd7f42e09c1","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-model8-hull-map.md","title":"ZFC Model8 Hull Map","display":"df-zfc-model8-hull-map — ZFC Model8 Hull Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model8-hull-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model8-hull-map"],"display":"df-zfc-model8-hull-map — ZFC Model8 Hull Map","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-skolem-hull.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model8-hull-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model8-hull-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model8-hull-map — ZFC Model8 Hull Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fb0405497b16b145\" href=\"?note=fb0405497b16b145\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-skolem-hull.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-skolem-hull.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in V\">\\(M\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\mathcal P(M)^{\\mathcal P(M)}\">\\(h\\in\\mathcal P(M)^{\\mathcal P(M)}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(h,\\mathcal P(M),\\mathcal P(M))\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(h,\\mathcal P(M),\\mathcal P(M))\\)</span> (function predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9SkolemHull}_S(H,A,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9SkolemHull}_S(H,A,M)\\)</span> (Skolem-hull predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel8HullMap}_S(h,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel8HullMap}_S(h,M)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}hull\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel8HullMap}_S(h,M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(h,\\mathcal P(M),\\mathcal P(M))\\land\\forall A\\subseteq M\\;\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9SkolemHull}_S(h(A),A,M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}hull\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel8HullMap}_S(h,M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(h,\\mathcal P(M),\\mathcal P(M))\\land\\forall A\\subseteq M\\;\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9SkolemHull}_S(h(A),A,M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Here <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> denotes the underlying set used by the canonical hull predicate, not the full tuple coding a structure. The map sends every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq M\">\\(A\\subseteq M\\)</span> to its least Skolem-closed hull.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-skolem-hull.md","status":"resolved","id":"fb0405497b16b145","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-skolem-hull.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in\\mathcal P(M)^{\\mathcal P(M)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(h,\\mathcal P(M),\\mathcal P(M))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9SkolemHull}_S(H,A,M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel8HullMap}_S(h,M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}hull\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel8HullMap}_S(h,M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(h,\\mathcal P(M),\\mathcal P(M))\\land\\forall A\\subseteq M\\;\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9SkolemHull}_S(h(A),A,M)","display":true},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq M","display":false}],"bytes":1056,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2799","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-model8-hull-map.md|58-df-zfc-model8-hull-map]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","fb0405497b16b145"]}